# i18n EN/DE

- Source of truth: `content/i18n.ts` (`Lang`, `LANGS`, nested dict). Projects: `content/projects.ts` + `localized()`.
- Always add/change **en and de together**. Mirror keys; keep tone calm and employer-facing (Germany-first).
- Routing: `app/[lang]/…`. `middleware.ts` sets/reads `hh-lang` on `/en` and `/de`; bare paths redirect to cookie or `de`.
- Root `app/page.tsx` fallbacks to `/de` only.
- Nav language switch is normal links under `/en`|/`/de` — visiting a lang path updates the cookie; no extra client cookie code needed.
- CV download: `cv(lang)` from `content/cv.ts` — replace PDFs in `public/cv/` without renaming unless updating `cv.ts`.
